/*
  PDFRender - document layer implementation.

  Robustness rules: offsets are never trusted (every span is bounds-
  checked), /Length is verified against the actual endstream keyword
  with a rescue scan when wrong, xref chains are depth-limited, and
  object loading carries a re-entrancy mark so reference cycles
  cannot recurse to death on the SVC stack.

